{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-29", "prepared_on": "2026-10-29", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-29</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Google launches Gemini 4 Carbon with a 'significant leap' in cybersecurity<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 推出 Gemini 4 Carbon，資安能力大幅躍進</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google released its latest frontier model, Gemini 4 Carbon, with significant gains in coding, agentic tasks, and cybersecurity. It tops the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index v5.0.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 發表最新旗艦模型 Gemini 4 Carbon，在程式碼、代理任務與資安方面大幅進步，並登上 Artificial Analysis 智慧指數 v5.0 榜首。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1021339/google-gemini-4-carbon-cybersecurity-frontier\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Anthropic IPO warns its AI could blackmail people, become sentient, end humanity<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 上市文件警告其 AI 可能勒索人類、產生意識、毀滅人類</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Seven potential AI nightmares pulled from Anthropic's 93-page \"Risk Factor\" section of its IPO filing.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">從 Anthropic 上市申請文件長達 93 頁的「風險因素」中，整理出七種 AI 潛在夢魘情境。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/anthropic-ipo-warns-its-ai-could-blackmail-people-become-sentient-end-humanity/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Google Cloud revenue doubles as search growth slows<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google Cloud 營收翻倍，搜尋業務成長放緩</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Alphabet's Q3 revenue rose 25% to $127.6B, with Google Cloud up 103% to over $30B. Slowing search growth and rising AI infrastructure spending raised profit concerns.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Alphabet 第三季營收年增 25% 至 1,275.77 億美元，Google Cloud 年增 103% 突破 300 億美元；搜尋成長放緩加上 AI 基礎設施投資擴大，引發獲利疑慮。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180051\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Anthropic launches tools showing companies what their AI spending buys<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 推出工具，讓企業看清 AI 支出的去向</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The frontier lab is lifting the curtain on how users spend money on its models ahead of a planned IPO.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">在計畫上市之前，這家前沿 AI 實驗室公開用戶如何在其模型上花錢，提高支出透明度。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/28/anthropic-just-launched-tools-to-show-companies-what-their-ai-spending-is-buying/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> PHP2Shell vulnerability reportedly exploited, attackers run shell commands on servers<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">重大漏洞 PHP2Shell 傳出駭客成功利用，於伺服器執行 Shell 指令</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Wiz and Calif say AI was key to finding the critical PHP flaws CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619, which are now reportedly being exploited.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">PHP 團隊上週公布並修補 CVE-2026-109618、CVE-2026-109619；發現漏洞的 Wiz 與 Calif 表示若無 AI 協助很難找出，如今傳出已遭駭客成功利用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180042\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Microsoft recorded $10 billion in revenue from OpenAI<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟單季自 OpenAI 取得 100 億美元營收</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft said it made $10 billion from commercial arrangements with OpenAI, including revenue sharing, in the quarter ending September 30.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟表示，截至 9 月 30 日的季度中，來自與 OpenAI 商業安排（含分潤）的營收達 100 億美元，顯示雙方財務依存仍然極高。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/28/microsoft-recorded-10-billion-in-revenue-from-openai/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Apple announces first touchscreen MacBook Pro, starting at $2,899<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">蘋果推出首款觸控 MacBook Pro，售價 2,899 美元起</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The new MacBook Pro features a dual-layer OLED display and brings the iPhone's Dynamic Island to the Mac. The glowing Apple logo also returns on the lid.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">蘋果發表首款支援觸控的 MacBook Pro，搭載雙層 OLED 顯示器並引進動態島設計，機蓋的發光蘋果標誌也睽違多年回歸。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180050\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Over 850 GitHub accounts compromised in Gheist campaign planting malicious workflows<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">逾 850 個 GitHub 帳號遭入侵，駭客發動 Gheist 攻擊植入惡意工作流程</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Wiz disclosed the Gheist campaign, where stolen GitHub tokens were used to plant malicious GitHub Actions workflows. Over 13,500 malicious branches were found.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Wiz 揭露 Gheist 攻擊活動：駭客利用遭竊的 GitHub 權杖在儲存庫植入惡意 Actions 工作流程，企圖竊密，涉及逾 1.35 萬個惡意分支。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179977\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Frontier AI labs say their models refuted the Exponential Time Hypothesis<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">前沿 AI 實驗室稱其模型推翻了指數時間假說，這代表什麼？</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">TechCrunch spoke to the MIT computer scientist charged with explaining OpenAI's latest mind-bending discovery.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">TechCrunch 訪問負責解釋 OpenAI 最新突破性發現的 MIT 電腦科學家，說明這項成果的意義。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/27/frontier-ai-labs-say-their-models-refuted-the-exponential-time-hypothesis-what-does-that-mean/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> CISA releases 2030 strategy, shifting to active defense and critical infrastructure protection<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">美國 CISA 公布 2030 戰略，轉向積極防禦並優先保護關鍵基礎設施</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">CISA's 2030 cybersecurity strategy moves from passive defense to proactive threat detection and removal, prioritizing critical infrastructure by risk and consequence.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">CISA 的 2030 資安戰略將從被動防禦轉向主動偵測與排除威脅，依風險與事故後果決定關鍵基礎設施的保護優先順序，並提升重大事件的應變與復原能力。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179974\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}